that I always say Rezzy?

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.619
- No, it's always, you said
you were a poor student, so.

00:03:17.619 --> 00:03:18.713
(laughing)

00:03:18.713 --> 00:03:19.546
- It's true.

00:03:19.546 --> 00:03:20.379
He's right.

00:03:20.379 --> 00:03:21.212
By the way, I don't know if you saw this,

00:03:21.212 --> 00:03:22.073
yesterday I put out a piece of content,

00:03:22.073 --> 00:03:24.452
oh, I didn't put it out
on my Instagram yet,

00:03:24.452 --> 00:03:25.844
the I suck video?

00:03:25.844 --> 00:03:27.581
I made a video in 2008 that said I suck,

00:03:27.581 --> 00:03:30.444
and one of the examples
of me saying that I suck

00:03:30.444 --> 00:03:34.749
