saying things the right way.

00:03:34.749 --> 00:03:36.133
'Cause in the wine world,

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:36.966
when I was doing Wine Library TV,

00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:40.027
I would get these hate emails from Italy

00:03:40.027 --> 00:03:42.715
and be like, "It's Barolo, not burrala."

00:03:42.715 --> 00:03:44.865
People would get so pissed at me.

00:03:44.865 --> 00:03:48.016
And literally I haven't
had that feeling for years

00:03:48.016 --> 00:03:49.586
until I started to giving you daps

00:03:49.586 --> 00:03:51.616
in the wrong pronunciation.

00:03:51.616 --> 00:03:53.411
- So apparently knowing that two vowels

00:03:53.411 --> 00:03:55.098
followed by a consanant is a long vowel

00:03:55.098 --> 00:03:58.095
doesn't really matter in
the grand scheme of things.

00:03:58.095 --> 00:03:58.928
