00:03:58.928 --> 00:03:59.888
I had never heard, is that true?

00:03:59.888 --> 00:04:01.073
I've never heard that in my life.

00:04:01.073 --> 00:04:03.233
- Two vowels is always long
when followed by a consanent.

00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:05.536
- Yeah I don't even know
what a fucking consanent is.

00:04:05.536 --> 00:04:06.801
- It's a non-vowel.

00:04:06.801 --> 00:04:08.425
But anyways.

00:04:08.425 --> 00:04:09.833
Yeah, I go by Reezy.

00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:10.705
I grew up super poor.

00:04:10.705 --> 00:04:12.866
Food stamps, welfare,
government healthcare.

00:04:12.866 --> 00:04:14.298
I never knew anyone that owned a business,

00:04:14.298 --> 00:04:16.809
had a nice car, no one in my
family graudated high school,

00:04:16.809 --> 00:04:19.115
