00:07:48.187 --> 00:07:49.475
I was like you can sell DVDs?

00:07:49.475 --> 00:07:50.308
I was super--

00:07:50.308 --> 00:07:51.572
- When are people gonna realize

00:07:51.572 --> 00:07:53.460
doing the right thing is the right thing?

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:54.964
Never?

00:07:54.964 --> 00:07:55.853
- I don't know, it's hard.

00:07:55.853 --> 00:07:58.125
For me I grew up in a
really selfish family.

00:07:58.125 --> 00:07:59.421
Not religious.

00:07:59.421 --> 00:08:00.732
Just super selfish.

00:08:00.732 --> 00:08:03.421
And then through following your blueprint

00:08:03.421 --> 00:08:04.430
and helping other people,

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.678
